        "created_at": "2014-03-27T23:01:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The kid on Mainstay's one card really doesn't look like Thiago to me; indeed, I'm not sure that's even a male child, looks sort of like a tomboyish girl to me.&nbsp; I'd assume that there's more than one youth in the world of SOTM who is inspired to wear a Legacy shirt and might get themself in danger.</p><p>Incidentally, while checking on this, I looked at the back of my Agent of Gloom Spite and noticed that it has three claw slashes through the wanted poster in the background.</p>",
