        "created_at": "2014-03-28T20:37:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It's not \"the child is <span class=\"bbcode-i\">at</span> the centre\", it's \"the child <span class=\"bbcode-i\">is</span> the centre\". I expect that probably makes a difference. The centre of <span class=\"bbcode-i\">what</span>, exactly, we don't know, but there has been some speculation that the \"centre\" referred to in the fluff text of one of Parse's cards might be <span class=\"bbcode-i\">that</span> centre. I forget the name of the card but it's the one with the giant golem thingy holding the Matriarch while Captain Cosmic flies toward her (and I think Parse is in the foreground with her bow aimed at something).</p>",
